    <string name="automation_help">Podlink sends implicit broadcasts other apps (MacroDroid “Intent received”, Tasker + AutoTools, Automate) can react to:\n\ndev.podlink.event.CONNECTED · DISCONNECTED · LID_OPENED · LID_CLOSED · IN_EAR · OUT_OF_EAR · BATTERY · LOW_BATTERY · FULLY_CHARGED · ANC\n\nExtras: left, right, case (int), leftCharging, rightCharging, caseCharging, leftInEar, rightInEar, lidOpen, connected (bool), model, name (string).\n\nCommands you can send to Podlink:\ndev.podlink.action.SET_ANC (extra mode = off | anc | transparency | adaptive)\ndev.podlink.action.CONNECT\ndev.podlink.action.REFRESH</string>
    <string name="about_text">Podlink reads Apple’s Proximity Pairing BLE beacons for battery, lid and in-ear state, and additionally tries Apple’s AAP channel for exact battery and controls. No root, no accounts, no internet permission.</string>
